{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:611d4a3b7592f3f2","name":"Disciple of Twilight Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-611d4a3b7592f3f2","title":"Disciple of Twilight Talent Tree","revision":20142,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:17:45Z","sha256":"3b80570d37326f09a30d57f59eb979390495e92aec69c517611524d0c8e35ee2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20142","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Disciple%20of%20Twilight%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-611d4a3b7592f3f2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Disciples of Twilight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Disciples_of_Twilight","referenceId":"reference:811f996c9c25fc13"}," embody shadow, using ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to manipulate light and darkness. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Disciples of Twilight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Disciples_of_Twilight","referenceId":"reference:811f996c9c25fc13"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cloak of Shadows"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to bend light around you, veiling yourself in shadows. Until the end of the encounter, whenever you move and end your movement at least 3 squares away from your starting position, you gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," from all targets until the beginning of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Phantasm"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you successfully use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}]},"] descriptor against a target, any time before the end of encounter you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to create illusory phantoms around that target. When you do this, you and all of your allies within the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," from the target until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Revelation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of an enemy that has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," from you or any of your allies. If successful, the enemy is silhouetted by a faint shimmering light that belies their location. Your target loses any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," bonuses to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shadow Armor"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cloak of Shadows"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to bend light around yourself, wrapping you in shadows and making it difficult for enemies to tell where you end and the shadows begin. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you grant yourself a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the start of your next turn. You may select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select it, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus it provides increases by +1 (to a maximum of +4).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shadow Vision"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", allowing you to ignore ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," (but not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"},") from darkness. This benefit lasts for 5 minutes or until the end of the encounter, whichever comes first.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
